---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Terms of Service · Blu Baby Show" description="The terms for using blubabyshow.com and buying from the Blu Shop.">
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Blu Baby Show</p>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: 15 November 2026</p>

      <p>These terms apply when you use <strong>blubabyshow.com</strong> or buy from the Blu Shop.
        By using the site or placing an order, you agree to them. "We" and "us" means Blu Baby Show.</p>

      <h2>1. What we sell</h2>
      <p>The Blu Shop sells <strong>digital products only</strong>: printable PDF files (soft copies) for parents and children.
        Nothing physical is shipped. Each product page describes what is inside, the number of pages and the price.</p>

      <h2>2. Prices and payment</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Prices are shown in Indian rupees (₹) for buyers in India and in US dollars ($) elsewhere. Any applicable taxes are shown at checkout.</li>
        <li>Payments are processed by <strong>Dodo Payments</strong>, which acts as the merchant of record for your order. Their checkout terms also apply to the payment.</li>
        <li>We may change prices at any time; the price you pay is the one shown at checkout.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Delivery</h2>
      <p>After a successful payment you get a download link on screen and by email, usually instantly and always within 24 hours.
        See our <a href="/delivery">Delivery Policy</a>. If the link doesn't arrive, email us and we will send it again.</p>

      <h2>4. Your licence to use the files</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You may download, view and print the files for <strong>personal, non-commercial use</strong> by your own family, home or classroom.</li>
        <li>You may not resell, share, upload, distribute or claim the files or artwork as your own.</li>
        <li>Blu, the characters, artwork, videos and this website are owned by Blu Baby Show and protected by copyright and trademark law.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Refunds and cancellations</h2>
      <p>Because the products are delivered instantly, an order can't be cancelled once paid. But if you're not happy,
        you can ask for a refund within 7 days. See our <a href="/refund">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>6. Not professional advice</h2>
      <p>Our guides and printables are friendly, general information made to support families. They are
        <strong>not medical, psychological or professional advice</strong>. Every child is different; for anything that
        worries you, talk to your paediatrician or a qualified professional.</p>

      <h2>7. Who can buy</h2>
      <p>You must be 18 or older (or have a parent or guardian's permission) to buy from the Blu Shop.</p>

      <h2>8. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>We provide the website and products "as is". To the fullest extent the law allows, our total liability for any
        order is limited to the amount you paid for it. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under consumer law.</p>

      <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any dispute will be handled by the courts of Bangalore, India.</p>

      <h2>10. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms. The version shown on this page on the day you order applies to that order.</p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>Blu Baby Show, Bangalore, India · <a href="mailto:blubabyshow@gmail.com">blubabyshow@gmail.com</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact page</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2rem); max-width: 720px; }
  .legal h1 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--blu-deep); }
  .legal ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .legal li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal a { color: var(--blu-d); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
